description.p:
Keys: F5 Run, or Continue while paused;
F10 Step; F11 Step In; Shift+F11 Step Out;
Shift+F5 Stop (dbquit); F12 Set/Clear
Breakpoint; F9 Evaluate Selection; F6 Pause, which pauses
a running program at its next statement; Ctrl+F10 Run to Here,
which runs to the cursor line and pauses before it.

example_item.example_item_data:
n = 50;
r = rand(n,1);
plot(r)

m = mean(r);
hold on
plot([0,n],[m,m])
hold off
title("Mean of Random Uniform Data")
